    "BandData[h, samples] collects the sorted eigenvalues of h at each \
sample, with one output list per band. BandData[h, samples, n] retains the n \
eigenvalues selected by Eigenvalues at each sample. BandData[{h, s}, samples] \
solves the generalized eigenvalue problem for the Hamiltonian h and overlap \
matrix s. BandData[{h, s}, samples, n] retains n eigenvalues from each \
generalized eigenvalue problem.", "synonyms" -> {}, "tabletags" -> {}, 
